+       column  光
+       column  别名
+       row  A  `incandescentTungstenColorimetry`  白炽钨丝灯
+       row  B  `oldDirectSunlightAtNoonColorimetry`  正午直射阳光，已废弃
+       row  C  `oldDaylightColorimetry`  平均北天空日光，已废弃
+       row  D50  `iccProfilePcsColorimetry`  ICC 配置文件连接空间
+       row  D55  `midMorningDaylightColorimetry`  上午或下午中段的日光
+       row  D65  `daylightColorimetry`  正午日光，常用选择  `srgbColorimetry`, `adobeRgbColorimetry`
+       row  D75  `northSkyDaylightColorimetry`  北天空日光
+       row  E  `equalEnergyColorimetry`  各波长能量相等
+       row  F1  `daylightFluorescentF1Colorimetry`  日光荧光灯
+       row  F2  `coolFluorescentColorimetry`  冷白荧光灯
+       row  F3  `whiteFluorescentColorimetry`  白色荧光灯
+       row  F4  `warmWhiteFluorescentColorimetry`  暖白荧光灯
+       row  F5  `daylightFluorescentF5Colorimetry`  日光荧光灯
+       row  F6  `liteWhiteFluorescentColorimetry`  淡白荧光灯
+       row  F7  `daylightFluorescentF7Colorimetry`  D65 模拟光源  `d65SimulatorColorimetry`
+       row  F8  `sylvaniaF40Colorimetry`  Sylvania F40，D50 模拟光源  `d50SimulatorColorimetry`
+       row  F9  `coolWhiteFluorescentColorimetry`  豪华冷白荧光灯

